As you walk toward the house, a large black cat scurries across the path, heading toward Johnny Carson's house.

Front Porch
You're standing on the front porch of the house. Next to the front door is a regulation mailbox endorsed by Buck Palace. Beneath the mailbox is a doorbell once rung by Sonny Tufts. To the south is a walkway.

